## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Top Bar
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.2.0
## Notes: RTS-style resource strip across the top of the screen: gold, bag supply, durability, XP rate, and performance. With Commander Orders, click your coordinates for a waypoint where you stand or Shift-click them to share where you stand with your group, and an optional readout shows the distance and arrival time to the waypoint the arrow is following.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Warrior_RallyingCry
## SavedVariables: CommanderTopBarDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Console, Commander_Orders

